WEBVTT

NOTE The on-screen lines, in order. Also the voiceover script. Do not upload as burned-in captions on LinkedIn: the type is already in the frame.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Trusted by 50+ teams. Stop.

00:02.000 --> 00:04.500
Check it before you say it.

00:04.500 --> 00:07.000
You do it. Rules check it.

00:07.000 --> 00:08.500
One: find the facts.

00:08.500 --> 00:11.500
Every marked fact names a source. Go.

00:11.500 --> 00:13.000
Two: check the facts.

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
Every fact has a verdict. True. Unsure. Go.

00:16.000 --> 00:17.500
Three: poke holes.

00:17.500 --> 00:19.500
At least one review disagrees. Go.

00:19.500 --> 00:21.000
Four: make it short.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.000
No new marked facts snuck in. Trusted by 50+ teams. Stop.

00:25.000 --> 00:27.500
Fix it before you say it.

00:27.500 --> 00:29.000
You strike it. Go.

00:29.000 --> 00:30.500
Five: write the note.

00:30.500 --> 00:33.000
Still marked as a draft. Ready.

00:33.000 --> 00:34.500
You press send.

00:34.500 --> 00:37.000
Every stamp: rules, not AI.

00:37.000 --> 00:39.500
honest.arcs.care. Paste marked facts.

00:39.500 --> 00:41.500
Press Check it. Go.

00:41.500 --> 00:44.500
honest.arcs.care. Nothing you paste is uploaded.
